# services/
# This folder will contain service layer files.
# Services encapsulate complex business logic that is shared
# across multiple controllers.
#
# Planned services (Phase 2+):
#   emailService.js       - Send transactional emails
#   cloudinaryService.js  - Upload, delete, transform Cloudinary assets
#   notificationService.js- Create and dispatch notifications
#   analyticsService.js   - Aggregate analytics data for the dashboard
